# yaw 310 into the hill to the cold room -27.4 41.9 .. -29.7 43.9 (floor ~8); the sign at -13 30.5. In to the room and out.
island Saint Agnes Sanatorium keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at -14 28.5 h=9.5
wait 2
read OLD COLD CELLARS
